{%- doc -%}
  PDP savings pill.

  The same calculation the product card already performs at
  snippets/product-card.liquid:277-285 - percentage, rounded, from the
  product's own compare-at and current price - rendered with the same
  .badge.badge--custom class so the PDP pill and the card pill look and read
  identically.

  It is stated here rather than shared because extracting it would mean editing
  product-card.liquid, which this project's scope rules exclude. The trade-off
  is real: the calculation now exists in two files, so a change to one must be
  mirrored in the other. Extracting both into one snippet later is the better
  end state.

  Note this is deliberately NOT product-badges.liquid: that snippet follows
  settings.discount_mode, which is set to the amount on this store and produces
  "SAVE $319.00". The card's inline version is always a percentage, and the
  design calls for the percentage.

  Renders nothing when the product is not on sale.

  Usage - a "Liquid" block directly after the Price block:

    {% render 'pdp-price-savings' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign compare_price = product.compare_at_price
  assign current_price = product.price
-%}

{%- if compare_price > current_price -%}
  {%- assign discount_percentage = compare_price | minus: current_price | times: 100.0 | divided_by: compare_price | round -%}
  <span class="badge badge--custom pdp-savings">{{ 'general.product.save' | t: percentage: discount_percentage }}</span>
{%- endif -%}
